{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mike and Tyler is a dialogue-free point-and-click detective adventure inspired by the stylish crime stories of the \u201980s \u2014 think Miami Vice vibes, neon-soaked locations, and sharp suits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of two unconventional detectives as they investigate a mysterious murder through forensic analysis, visual clues, and puzzle-driven deduction. There are no text conversations and no spoken lines \u2014 everything is communicated through expressive visuals, environments, and gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a story you read.<br>It\u2019s a case you solve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > FEATURES</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forensic Investigation Gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1300350/extras/4f79a8dbd5263c4a144c0764a55830d4.avif?t=1767186074\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Examine physical evidence, compare details, and identify subtle patterns that connect clues to suspects.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure Visual Deduction</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1300350/extras/ccba831ed72fd6ab4a79d6c31762b96b.avif?t=1767186074\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>No dialogue, no text conversations \u2014 every conclusion comes from observation and logical thinking.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control Two Detectives</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Switch between Mike and Tyler and use both characters together to solve puzzles that require cooperation and timing.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle-First Design</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Progress through cleverly designed puzzles rather than dialogue trees or story choices.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized Retro Presentation</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A clean, expressive visual style with comic-inspired elements that tell a story without words.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1300350?t=1767186074","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1300350?t=1767186074","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1300350/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767186074","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1300350/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767186074","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":1312680,"description":"Play the Demo"}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mike and Tyler is a dialogue-free point-and-click detective adventure inspired by the stylish crime stories of the \u201980s \u2014 think Miami Vice vibes, neon-soaked locations, and sharp suits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of two unconventional detectives as they investigate a mysterious murder through forensic analysis, visual clues, and puzzle-driven deduction. There are no text conversations and no spoken lines \u2014 everything is communicated through expressive visuals, environments, and gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a story you read.<br>It\u2019s a case you solve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > FEATURES</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forensic Investigation Gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1300350/extras/4f79a8dbd5263c4a144c0764a55830d4.avif?t=1767186074\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Examine physical evidence, compare details, and identify subtle patterns that connect clues to suspects.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure Visual Deduction</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1300350/extras/ccba831ed72fd6ab4a79d6c31762b96b.avif?t=1767186074\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>No dialogue, no text conversations \u2014 every conclusion comes from observation and logical thinking.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control Two Detectives</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Switch between Mike and Tyler and use both characters together to solve puzzles that require cooperation and timing.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle-First Design</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Progress through cleverly designed puzzles rather than dialogue trees or story choices.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized Retro Presentation</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A clean, expressive visual style with comic-inspired elements that tell a story without words.</i></p>","developers":["Sinking Sheep"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"htt